    "theorem_replayed": "v2(U_m)=s_2(m), so H_m=N_m/2^(3m-s_2(m)) in lowest terms; for any distinct odd zero primes Z_m, sum_(p in Z_m) log p <=log N_m<(3m-s_2(m)+1/2)log 2"
